                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 14040/11.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Eddy to the
                            Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Buenos
                                Aires</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1908-09-24"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">September 24,
                    1908</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Damiano extradition granted. Agent expects to leave October 10, steamship <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Velasquez.</hi></p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Eddy.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
